  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 3.0.2: Google Speech-to-Text Removal\n\nBREAKING CHANGES:\n• Google Speech-to-Text completely removed\n• Whisper.net is now the only audio transcription provider\n• 100% local audio processing\n\nBENEFITS:\n• Enhanced privacy and GDPR/KVKK/HIPAA compliance\n• Simplified configuration\n• Reduced dependencies\n• Better performance with local processing\n\nMIGRATION:\n• Update AudioProvider to Whisper only\n• Remove GoogleSpeechConfig from appsettings.json\n• Install Whisper.net models for local transcription\n\nThis release removes Google Speech-to-Text dependency and focuses on local audio processing.",
